{"id":"9414b81590d67b46","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-optimal-proof-system.md","title":"Optimal Proof System","display":"df-optimal-proof-system — Optimal Proof System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-optimal-proof-system","aliases":["72-df-optimal-proof-system"],"display":"df-optimal-proof-system — Optimal Proof System","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]","[[72-df-proof-system-comparison]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Theorem 10.4.1(2); printed p. 626; PDF p. 638","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-optimal-proof-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-optimal-proof-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-optimal-proof-system — Optimal Proof System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b16c13e741889b14\" href=\"?note=b16c13e741889b14\" title=\"72-df-proof-system-comparison\">72-df-proof-system-comparison</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, Theorem 10.4.1(2); printed p. 626; PDF p. 638"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}\">\\(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathrm{sim}}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathrm{sim}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_p\">\\(\\leq_p\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b16c13e741889b14\" href=\"?note=b16c13e741889b14\" title=\"72-df-proof-system-comparison\">72-df-proof-system-comparison</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\">\\(P,Q\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 的总函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Optimal},\\mathrm{POptimal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Optimal},\\mathrm{POptimal}\\)</span> 是 Assertion 构造的两类证明系统。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Optimal}=\\{P:\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\land\n\\forall Q\\;(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(Q)\\to Q\\leq_{\\mathrm{sim}}P)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Optimal}=\\{P:\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\land\n\\forall Q\\;(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(Q)\\to Q\\leq_{\\mathrm{sim}}P)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{POptimal}=\\{P:\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\land\n\\forall Q\\;(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(Q)\\to Q\\leq_pP)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{POptimal}=\\{P:\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\land\n\\forall Q\\;(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(Q)\\to Q\\leq_pP)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{POptimal}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Optimal}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{POptimal}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Optimal}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Chapter VIII，Theorem 10.4.1(2)，印刷页 626，PDF 页 638。原书的 optimal 要求各系统的最短证明大小被一个依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 的多项式界控制，并不在该定义中要求转换算法。</li>\n<li>原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Optimal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Optimal}\\)</span> 事实上定义了 p-optimal。本次恢复原书的 optimal 含义，同时用单独的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{POptimal}\">\\(\\mathrm{POptimal}\\)</span> 保留原来的较强概念；包含式由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b16c13e741889b14\" href=\"?note=b16c13e741889b14\" title=\"72-df-proof-system-comparison\">72-df-proof-system-comparison</a> 的输出长度论证推出。</li>\n<li>Existence of an optimal proof system is a separate open/conditional question and is not asserted by this definition. 此处同样不主张 p-optimal 系统存在，也不使用这两个存在性问题的当前研究状态。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-system-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"b16c13e741889b14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-system-comparison]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]；$\\leq_{\\mathrm{sim}}$ 与 $\\leq_p$ 如 [[72-df-proof-system-comparison]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-system-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"b16c13e741889b14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]；$\\leq_{\\mathrm{sim}}$ 与 $\\leq_p$ 如 [[72-df-proof-system-comparison]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-system-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"b16c13e741889b14","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原来的 $\\mathrm{Optimal}$ 事实上定义了 p-optimal。本次恢复原书的 optimal 含义，同时用单独的 $\\mathrm{POptimal}$ 保留原来的较强概念；包含式由 [[72-df-proof-system-comparison]] 的输出长度论证推出。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathrm{sim}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_p","display":false},{"tex":"P,Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Optimal},\\mathrm{POptimal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Optimal}=\\{P:\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\land\n\\forall Q\\;(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(Q)\\to Q\\leq_{\\mathrm{sim}}P)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{POptimal}=\\{P:\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\land\n\\forall Q\\;(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(Q)\\to Q\\leq_pP)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{POptimal}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Optimal}.","display":true},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Optimal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{POptimal}","display":false}],"bytes":2125,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-247","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-optimal-proof-system|df-optimal-proof-system — Optimal Proof System]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-247","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-optimal-proof-system|df-optimal-proof-system — Optimal Proof System]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-optimal-proof-system|72-df-optimal-proof-system]]"}],"outgoing":["d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","b16c13e741889b14"]}